# does not settle: S-85 -- the seed runs zone 1 backwards (a plain split hands every branch the whole flow).
# Layout ladder, step 12b (29, C-128): step 12 with its instruments.
# Each zone valve holds its return temperature, the pump holds the pressure at the index point, and a
# flow meter reads the supply.

fluidscript 1
circuit zones
fluid water

PU1 pump
HE1 heat_exchanger power=60 out.t=70
CV1 valve kv=4
CV2 valve kv=4
CV3 valve kv=4
LD1 heat_exchanger power=-20
LD2 heat_exchanger power=-20
LD3 heat_exchanger power=-20
TC1 pid kp=2
TC2 pid kp=2
TC3 pid kp=2
PC1 pid kp=1
TE1 t_sensor at NR1
TE2 t_sensor at NR2
TE3 t_sensor at NR3
PE1 p_sensor at NP
FE1 flow_sensor at NS

connections
PU1 - HE1
HE1 - NS
NS - NA1
NA1 - CV1 - LD1 - NR1 - NB1
NA1 - NA2
NA2 - CV2 - LD2 - NR2 - NB2
NA2 - CV3 - LD3 - NR3 - NB2
NB2 - NB1
NB1 - NP
NP - PU1

control CV1 with TE1 by TC1 setpoint=40
control CV2 with TE2 by TC2 setpoint=40
control CV3 with TE3 by TC3 setpoint=40
control PU1 with PE1 by PC1 setpoint=150
